HAVE EITHER CROSSED ILLEGALLY

00:08:49.207 --> 00:08:51.041
INTO THE U.S. OR MOVE TO OTHER

00:08:51.042 --> 00:08:52.876
MEXICAN BORDER CITIES OR SIMPLY

00:08:52.877 --> 00:08:54.044
FALLEN THROUGH THE CRACKS WHICH

00:08:54.045 --> 00:08:56.813
IS WHY THE PRESIDENT IS STANDING

00:08:56.814 --> 00:08:58.281
FIRM, AND RIGHTLY SO, ON THE

00:08:58.282 --> 00:09:00.017
BORDER WALL.

00:09:00.018 --> 00:09:00.717
FORGING AHEAD ON KEEPING HIS

00:09:00.718 --> 00:09:02.786
PROMISE TO THE FORGOTTEN MEN AND

00:09:02.787 --> 00:09:05.589
WOMEN OF THIS COUNTRY TO

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:08.025
PRESERVE OUR NATION'S SAFETY AND

00:09:08.026 --> 00:09:10.127
SECURITY FIRST.

00:09:10.128 --> 00:09:11.361
REMEMBER, THE WALL WILL HELP

00:09:11.362 --> 00:09:13.463
PEOPLE ON BOTH SIDES BE SAFER

00:09:13.464 --> 00:09:16.833
AND THEN OF COURSE, THE WALL

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:20.270
WILL HAVE A BIG DOOR THAT YOU

00:09:20.271 --> 00:09:23.941
CAN COME IN LEGALLY.

